# Keep Docker build context tiny — Edgegap plugin runs `docker build` from the Unity project root.
# The Dockerfile only COPYs Builds/EdgegapServer and tools/edgegap/start-server.sh.

*
!Builds/
Builds/*
!Builds/EdgegapServer/
!Builds/EdgegapServer/**

!tools/
tools/*
!tools/edgegap/
!tools/edgegap/start-server.sh
